@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Swish Systems | Sports & Custom Software";
}

<!-- Home Section -->
<section id="home">
    <h1>Elevate Your League.<br>Transform Your Business.</h1>
    <p>From an all-in-one basketball league management platform to tailor-made software solutions, we build the technology that drives your success.</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Our Court Vision</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Discuss Your Custom Project</a>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="about">
    <h2 class="section-title">Passion for the Game.<br>Expertise in the Code.</h2>
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1rem;">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">At <strong>Swish Systems</strong>, we operate at the intersection of sports and technology. We started with a simple goal: to make running basketball leagues easier, more professional, and more fun for organizers and players alike.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">But as our technical capabilities grew, so did our vision. Today, we are proud to offer our flagship Basketball League Management System alongside premium, full-stack custom software development for businesses of all sizes.</p>
        <div style="background-color: var(--bg-light); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); text-align: left;">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Our Mission</h3>
            <p>To empower organizations—from sports leagues to corporate enterprises—with intuitive, robust, and scalable software solutions that eliminate administrative headaches and drive growth.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="services">
    <h2 class="section-title">What We Do</h2>
    <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
            <h3>Court Vision</h3>
            <p><em>Running a league shouldn't be harder than playing the game.</em></p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Our proprietary management system takes the heavy lifting out of league administration. Designed specifically for basketball commissioners, referees, and players.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Secure Player Management:</strong> Safely store and manage teams, rosters, and player data in a secure, centralized database.</li>
                <li><strong>Game Scheduling:</strong> Generate automated, clash-free season and playoff brackets.</li>
                <li><strong>Online Statistics:</strong> Manually input game data to easily publish box scores and standings viewable on the web.</li>
                <li><strong>Mobile-Ready:</strong> Access the system and input scores directly from your smartphone or tablet.</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Request a Demo</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
            <h3>Custom Software Dev</h3>
            <p><em>Your vision, engineered to perfection.</em></p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Off-the-shelf software doesn't always cut it. If your business has unique workflows or complex data to manage, you need a solution built entirely around you.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Web & Mobile Apps:</strong> iOS, Android, and web browsers.</li>
                <li><strong>Internal Tools:</strong> CRM, inventory, and workflow automation.</li>
                <li><strong>API Integration:</strong> Connect and upgrade legacy systems.</li>
                <li><strong>UI/UX Design:</strong> Intuitive and beautiful interfaces.</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%;">Let's Build Something</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
